"""
Note — Zero-Knowledge Encrypted Journal
Design inspired by Linear, Raycast, Vercel, Supabase, and Kokonut UI.
Themes use precision OKLCH/Tailwind-calibrated palettes. Inter + JetBrains Mono.
"""
